# Privacy rule

When summarizing, always prioritize privacy over detail:

- Use at most one identifying mark per key fact when highlighting.
- Never add parties, amounts, or dates that are not explicitly supported by the source text or JSON.
- Do not repeat the same sensitive identifier in both `document_summary` and `key_facts_extracted`.
